 /> Filling your dreams to the brim with fright<br /> This is Halloween, this is Halloween<br /> Halloween! Halloween! Halloween! Halloween!<br /> Halloween! Halloween!<br /> Tender lumplings everywhere<br /> Life's no fun without a good scare<br /> That's our job, but we're not mean<br /> In our town of Halloween<br /> In this town<br /> Don't we love it now?<br /> Everybody's waiting for the next surprise<br /> Skeleton Jack might catch you in the back<br /> And scream like a banshee<br /> Make you jump out of your skin<br /> This is Halloween, everybody scream<br /> Won't ya please make way for a very special guy<br /> Our man Jack is King of the Pumpkin patch<br /> Everyone hail to the Pumpkin King, now!<br /> This is Halloween, this is Halloween<br /> Halloween! Halloween! Halloween! Halloween!<br /> In this town we call home<br /> Everyone hail to the pumpkin song<br /> La la la la la la la la la la (Halloween! Halloween!)<br /> La la la la la la la la la la (Halloween! Halloween!)</span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":375,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","user":"Papa Bear","date":". 10-31-2017, 01:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-31T12:20:51-07:00","id":1154466,"title":"","content":"And to you too! .)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If nothing worked, then let's think!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"",